      <details><summary>How do I book a consultation?</summary><div class="msv__faq-body"><p>Book directly through the website at <a href="/book-consultation.html">myspanishvisa.com/book-consultation</a>. Consultations are available by phone or video call. We aim to offer appointments within 2&ndash;3 business days.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>How quickly will you respond to my enquiry?</summary><div class="msv__faq-body"><p>We aim to respond within one business day (Monday&ndash;Friday). During peak periods (January&ndash;March and June&ndash;July), response times may be slightly longer.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>What information should I include in my enquiry?</summary><div class="msv__faq-body"><p>It helps to include: your nationality, approximate age, reason for moving to Spain, rough income or savings level, whether you are applying alone or with family, and any specific questions about the process.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Can I get advice if my visa has been refused?</summary><div class="msv__faq-body"><p>Yes. We assist with cases following refusal &mdash; we assess whether an appeal or reapplication is the better route, and ensure the next application directly addresses the specific refusal grounds.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Do you help people already living in Spain?</summary><div class="msv__faq-body"><p>Yes. We assist with TIE renewals, NLV and DNV renewals, long-term residency applications, citizenship queries, visa type changes, and post-arrival bureaucratic support including NIE and padr&oacute;n registration.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>What are your fees?</summary><div class="msv__faq-body"><p>Fees depend on the service. We provide transparent quotes before any work begins &mdash; no hidden charges, no surprises. Get in touch for a quotation tailored to your situation.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Are you regulated to provide immigration advice?</summary><div class="msv__faq-body"><p>My Spanish Visa operates in partnership with Platinum Legal Spain, a regulated Spanish law firm with bar-registered solicitors and qualified immigration lawyers.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Is my information handled securely?</summary><div class="msv__faq-body"><p>Yes. All information is handled in accordance with GDPR. We do not share your personal details with third parties without your consent.</p></div></details>
